      "title": "Welcome",
      "description": "### Welcome to the ADAgentAI tours\n\nThese tours walk through the real code, one step at a time. Each step opens a file and lights up the lines it talks about.\n\n**How to move:** use the Next and Previous buttons on this note, or Ctrl+→ and Ctrl+← (Cmd on a Mac).\n\n**How each note is written:**\n- **What it is** — what you're looking at\n- **How it works** — what the code does\n- **Why it matters** — why it's built this way\n- **Watch out** — the non-obvious part, or what someone could catch you on\n- **New idea** — a concept, explained the first time it shows up\n\n**Version:** written for commit `4f30889` (Feb 11, 2026). If you change a file, its steps may point a few lines off.\n\nHere is the whole system on one page:\n\n![How the parts connect](./.tours/assets/adagentai-map.png)"
    },
    {
      "file": "README.md",
